{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"764","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Taymyr is calling you"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"255 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Comrade Dujikov is busy choosing artists for Timofey's birthday and is recieving calls from Taymyr from Ilia-alpinist."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Ilia-alpinist calls every "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes, i.e. in minutes "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and so on. Artists come to the comrade every "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes, i.e. in minutes "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2m"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3m"},{"kind":"text","text":" and so on. The day is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"z"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes long, i.e. the day consists of minutes "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1, 2, ..., z"},{"kind":"text","text":". How many artists should be killed so that there are no artists in the room when Ilia calls? Consider that a call and a talk with an artist take exactly one minute."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only string contains three integers — "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"z"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n, m, z ≤ 104"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print single integer — the minimum number of artists that should be killed so that there are no artists in the room when Ilia calls."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1 1 10\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1 2 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 3 9\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Taymyr is a place in the north of Russia."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test the artists come each minute, as well as the calls, so we need to kill all of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test we need to kill artists which come on the second and the fourth minutes."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third test — only the artist which comes on the sixth minute. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"764A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/764/problem/A"}